WEBVTT

00:20.645 --> 00:22.814
He is currently in a sleep state.

00:26.860 --> 00:29.779
He wakes up sitting up cross-legged,

00:29.863 --> 00:34.576
stays awake for a few hours,
then falls asleep for another 24 hours.

00:34.659 --> 00:35.994
It's all understandable.

00:36.077 --> 00:38.496
His entire memory is gone, after all.

00:38.580 --> 00:41.708
How is he retaining new information
since getting resuscitated?

00:41.791 --> 00:42.709
It's normal.

00:43.293 --> 00:45.712
He has learned about
30 English words so far.

00:45.795 --> 00:50.842
However,
he does not comprehend his identity.

00:52.802 --> 00:53.887
Even his family…

00:54.971 --> 00:58.391
He doesn't show any response,
even to his daughter's photos.

01:02.854 --> 01:05.774
His brain waves and EKG are
within normal parameters.

01:05.857 --> 01:09.319
But his muscle mass has decreased.

01:09.402 --> 01:16.242
With all his memories gone,
he does not feel any reason to live,

01:16.826 --> 01:20.413
causing the body to rapidly atrophy.

01:21.790 --> 01:23.875
What can we do, Doctor?

01:24.876 --> 01:26.169
I cannot say.

01:26.252 --> 01:30.632
His only chance of recovery might be
retrieving his memory.

01:32.342 --> 01:34.636
Doctor, do not touch his head!

01:38.765 --> 01:39.933
He got hurt!

01:40.016 --> 01:40.850
We must treat him!

01:40.934 --> 01:45.104
I'm sorry, Doctor. I forgot to warn you.

01:45.188 --> 01:47.190
Did he use his Stand just now?

01:47.273 --> 01:50.610
He did. However,
that wasn't from his consciousness.

01:50.693 --> 01:53.488
It was just his instinctive bodily reflex
to defend.

01:57.117 --> 01:59.702
"Jo… Lyne."

01:59.786 --> 02:00.870
"Jolyne"?

02:01.746 --> 02:05.875
No… that's not possible.

02:15.009 --> 02:16.553
I've always…

02:18.138 --> 02:22.475
I've always cared about you.

02:25.061 --> 02:27.397
Something's going on with your cut.

02:27.981 --> 02:32.235
It was fixed. I know I just filled it in.

02:33.361 --> 02:36.948
It looks like some sort of writing,
doesn't it?

02:37.615 --> 02:39.242
Should I try to fill it again?

02:39.325 --> 02:40.493
Wait.

02:41.202 --> 02:42.787
Don't fill this one.

02:45.290 --> 02:47.542
I can't explain it, but…

02:47.625 --> 02:48.918
I just know it.

02:49.502 --> 02:52.589
This is a message from my father.

02:54.257 --> 02:58.845
He's had so much to protect
even before I was born.

02:59.470 --> 03:04.350
He was always away to keep dangers
like the one I'm in now

03:04.434 --> 03:07.729
away from me and Mom.

03:10.023 --> 03:12.358
I felt it, just now.

03:12.442 --> 03:16.529
 My body tells me that
I understand my father now.

04:49.747 --> 04:52.000
EPISODE 19: BIRTH OF THE "GREEN"

04:52.083 --> 04:54.377
- Hey F.F.
- What?

04:54.460 --> 04:57.964
Can you trip Jolyne down the stairs?

04:58.047 --> 05:00.508
Just a little bit will do.

05:01.968 --> 05:03.344
Why would I do that?

05:03.428 --> 05:06.389
I said, try to trip her.

05:07.015 --> 05:09.767
We won't let her get hurt, of course.

05:09.851 --> 05:13.730
I want to catch her from falling
with my own arms.

05:13.813 --> 05:15.023
What?

05:16.024 --> 05:20.778
Jolyne doesn't seem like
she understood that I saved her.

05:21.446 --> 05:25.325
I want to embrace her tightly
one more time.

05:25.408 --> 05:27.535
Now, get to it.

05:27.618 --> 05:30.163
- Trip her.
- Why don't you do it?

05:30.246 --> 05:31.414
That's sexual harassment.

05:31.497 --> 05:35.251
I already told you.
I'm going to marry Jolyne.

05:35.335 --> 05:40.506
And you promised to cooperate.
Or do you not keep your word?

05:44.385 --> 05:45.219
Now, go do it.

05:49.140 --> 05:51.184
I'm sorry, Jolyne.

05:54.687 --> 05:56.105
The small man!

05:56.189 --> 05:57.315
He's right here!

05:57.398 --> 05:59.776
He was spying on us from above!

06:02.028 --> 06:04.781
Look! He has the bone in his hand!

06:14.499 --> 06:19.295
This fucker sure moves in a funny way,
but he won't get away!

06:19.378 --> 06:20.421
Hold it!

06:21.631 --> 06:23.299
Do you see his back contorting?

06:29.180 --> 06:31.349
You called him a small man.

06:31.432 --> 06:33.893
It's true he fit the description earlier.

06:33.976 --> 06:37.647
- But something strange is happening…
- Sunbathing…

06:37.730 --> 06:39.732
Isn't he growing taller?

06:40.358 --> 06:43.861
He's as tall as me,
no, he's taller than me now.

06:43.945 --> 06:46.572
You have nowhere to run.

06:46.656 --> 06:48.825
Turn around slowly.

06:49.450 --> 06:51.744
The sunlight is nice and warm.

06:51.828 --> 06:52.912
Light is good.

06:52.995 --> 06:56.040
I said turn around, you little shit!

06:58.543 --> 06:59.502
Bleh…

07:01.295 --> 07:02.296
Bleh.

07:09.512 --> 07:11.848
What the fuck is with him?

07:11.931 --> 07:16.018
Light, bleh, warm.

07:16.644 --> 07:20.314
We are happy… as we gather around…

07:20.398 --> 07:21.858
and it's warm.

07:22.358 --> 07:23.317
Bleh.

07:29.740 --> 07:30.741
What was that?

07:30.825 --> 07:34.704
Did you see that stuff splatter?
He could be a Stand User!

07:34.787 --> 07:36.205
Keep your distance.

07:36.289 --> 07:37.665
It doesn't seem to be a Stand.

07:38.207 --> 07:41.544
I don't know what it is,
but we mustn't touch him.

07:42.128 --> 07:43.588
Where's the bone?

07:43.671 --> 07:47.258
The bone he had earlier. Where is it now?

08:03.316 --> 08:04.400
What the…

08:04.484 --> 08:08.988
The other prisoners
have already fallen prey.

08:09.071 --> 08:13.493
Those look like plants.
They're still growing.

08:14.076 --> 08:17.455
What happened to them, and who did this?

08:18.581 --> 08:20.791
What is the meaning of this?

08:23.669 --> 08:27.924
Should I assume that it's a Stand ability?

08:28.424 --> 08:29.592
This bone,

08:30.343 --> 08:34.263
along with the power and some sort of will
that sprouted these plants…

08:34.347 --> 08:37.266
It's as if they are trying to
give birth to something.

08:37.767 --> 08:42.939
It bloomed the flowers first,
then the plants matured.

08:43.022 --> 08:44.899
They grew out at
the end of the person's life.

08:44.982 --> 08:51.405
Now, what to do with this bone
that the man dropped…

08:51.906 --> 08:56.869
Merely touching this bone
or anyone who grabbed it

08:56.953 --> 08:58.538
can be dangerous, after all.

09:00.498 --> 09:02.917
Don't take another step, Jolyne Cujoh!

09:03.000 --> 09:04.961
Stop right there!

09:09.465 --> 09:10.967
Show me your face.

09:11.551 --> 09:13.177
Turn around.

09:18.683 --> 09:20.518
- What?
- It's nothing.

09:20.601 --> 09:23.312
I want to take a moment to
check something.

09:31.445 --> 09:34.407
What the hell is wrong with you?

09:34.490 --> 09:36.242
Let go of her, asshole!

09:36.325 --> 09:38.703
F.F., you stay silent.

09:38.786 --> 09:43.124
The bone transformed the prisoners
in the Disciplinary Wing into that state.

09:43.207 --> 09:45.001
It can't be an enemy Stand,

09:45.084 --> 09:48.671
since that would have
targeted us from the start.

09:48.754 --> 09:51.340
And if I'm not mistaken, Jolyne,

09:51.424 --> 09:57.305
I think I saw your thread touching
that bone when it was still in his grasp.

10:09.817 --> 10:11.736
The bone! It's rolling away!

10:15.072 --> 10:17.241
She's infected!

10:17.325 --> 10:18.868
Jolyne!

10:20.161 --> 10:21.495
But how?

10:24.165 --> 10:25.875
Diver Drive!

10:27.668 --> 10:28.794
Yes!

10:28.878 --> 10:32.923
Weed them all out from the inside, quick!

10:33.924 --> 10:35.468
There's more!

10:35.551 --> 10:36.761
Why did you stop?

10:36.844 --> 10:41.140
I wouldn't exactly say they're growing out
of her or that they need to be rooted out.

10:41.223 --> 10:44.310
Rather, her body itself
is transforming into plants.

10:44.393 --> 10:47.021
Is it safe to pull them out?

10:47.104 --> 10:48.606
Jolyne, does it hurt?

10:50.566 --> 10:51.442
No.

10:51.525 --> 10:54.945
I guess I did touch that bone.

10:55.571 --> 10:59.283
Anyway, you should stay away from me
now that I'm infected.

10:59.909 --> 11:01.452
It might spread to you.

11:07.625 --> 11:11.420
These are just plants,
nothing more, nothing less.

11:12.213 --> 11:14.006
I can't tell what species they are,

11:14.090 --> 11:17.760
but its stems are filled
with chlorophyll, not blood.

11:17.843 --> 11:22.390
Either way,
I'll take care of it. I promise.

11:33.359 --> 11:34.568
The sunlight!

11:34.652 --> 11:36.362
Get in the shade.

11:36.445 --> 11:38.739
If you touch sunlight
or move toward the light,

11:38.823 --> 11:40.491
the plants will grow rapidly.

11:40.574 --> 11:43.744
Step farther into the shade,
and the plants recede.

11:43.828 --> 11:47.373
Damn, what does it want?

11:47.456 --> 11:52.128
I can't say,
but I still need to get that bone.

11:52.211 --> 11:53.712
And just how will you do that?

11:53.796 --> 11:57.508
If you hold the bone,
you'll turn into a plant, Jolyne!

11:58.092 --> 11:59.343
I will pick it up.

12:00.803 --> 12:02.263
I'm already becoming a plant.

12:05.224 --> 12:09.186
Don't go where
the sunlight touches, Jolyne!

12:09.812 --> 12:12.273
The bone… Where is it?

12:13.274 --> 12:14.650
Where can it be?

12:14.733 --> 12:18.487
I thought I saw it rolling
towards this flower.

12:21.031 --> 12:22.450
A star shape?

12:22.533 --> 12:25.161
What is this bruise-like mark?

12:25.995 --> 12:28.873
It's see-through.
There's something else underneath.

12:31.125 --> 12:32.543
A child…

12:33.961 --> 12:35.546
It's a green child!

12:42.219 --> 12:43.971
STAND NAME: YA-YA MA
STAND MASTER: D AN' G

12:44.513 --> 12:46.056
What is it shaped like?

12:47.433 --> 12:52.188
Carrots that look like Snoopy,
breast-shaped radishes, and other shapes

12:52.271 --> 12:54.398
are found all the time during harvests.

12:54.482 --> 12:56.567
This is just like those.

12:58.611 --> 13:00.362
It really just resembles a child.

13:03.574 --> 13:05.993
It's alive! Impossible!

13:06.076 --> 13:09.705
Jolyne, forget about it and come back!

13:09.788 --> 13:11.165
Haven't you noticed?

13:11.248 --> 13:14.376
Your legs are turning too.
They are attaching to the vines!

13:14.460 --> 13:20.299
What is this thing?
Is it a plant, or is it a human?

13:20.382 --> 13:22.426
It turned the prisoners
in the Disciplinary Wing into plants,

13:22.510 --> 13:24.845
joined their roots, and became a fruit!

13:25.971 --> 13:30.226
The bone must have gotten
implanted inside this fruit.

13:30.309 --> 13:34.813
Pale Snake is at this prison
to discover what lies beyond this point.

13:35.397 --> 13:37.399
What will it spawn?

13:37.483 --> 13:40.945
He wants to know
what transpires when it is born.

13:41.028 --> 13:43.489
I told you to come back, Jolyne.

13:43.572 --> 13:47.284
The sun is moving westward,
causing more sunlight to enter.

13:47.368 --> 13:49.703
You must move further back.

13:51.455 --> 13:53.541
Are you taking that with you?

13:53.624 --> 13:57.253
We call this seizing by force, F.F.

13:58.045 --> 14:00.548
I will not let Pale Snake have it.

14:01.048 --> 14:02.591
Come, Jolyne.

14:02.675 --> 14:05.094
We must move opposite the sun's direction.

14:06.595 --> 14:07.888
Anastasia.

14:07.972 --> 14:10.516
This wing's entrance is to the west.

14:10.599 --> 14:13.143
We'll never leave this shitty place
if we go east.

14:13.227 --> 14:18.274
There's at least one other Stand User
somewhere in this wing.

14:23.070 --> 14:25.072
Escape, huh.

14:31.996 --> 14:34.582
Help me, please.

14:35.165 --> 14:37.334
Someone help!

14:37.418 --> 14:38.878
Please!

14:38.961 --> 14:43.090
After everyone drowned, they turned
into plants and died! How horrible!

14:43.173 --> 14:44.717
I'm begging you!

14:44.800 --> 14:47.928
I don't want to turn into a plant!
Please, get me out of here!

14:48.012 --> 14:49.138
Fine.

14:49.722 --> 14:52.349
What's your name? Are you hurt?

14:53.058 --> 14:56.145
What are you saying, Anastasia?
He could be our enemy.

14:56.228 --> 14:59.607
Are they right? Are you against us?

14:59.690 --> 15:01.984
I don't know what you are talking about.

15:02.067 --> 15:03.485
My name is Guccio.

15:04.403 --> 15:07.072
I just don't want to turn into a plant!

15:08.741 --> 15:12.786
Calm down. I said it's fine.

15:12.870 --> 15:16.123
Stand up, Guccio.
Surely you can do that much.

15:17.666 --> 15:19.209
Now hurry it up.

15:26.175 --> 15:27.092
Do you know this?

15:28.177 --> 15:31.889
A human has 12 pairs of ribs,
or 24 bones in total.

15:31.972 --> 15:36.769
Whether a man or a woman, tall or short,
we all have the same number of ribs.

15:38.729 --> 15:40.397
Good. Now go.

15:44.109 --> 15:47.363
I guess he wasn't our enemy after all.

15:47.446 --> 15:49.823
I couldn't care less either way.

15:50.407 --> 15:52.201
I'm only interested

15:52.284 --> 15:56.288
in safely leaving through
the east side of this building.

15:56.872 --> 15:57.831
Isn't that right?

15:57.915 --> 15:59.959
The keyword is "safely."

16:05.839 --> 16:07.174
Let's leave from there.

16:09.718 --> 16:11.637
A green child…

16:12.680 --> 16:17.142
I wasn't told about any of this,

16:17.851 --> 16:20.479
but my job is simple.

16:20.562 --> 16:24.650
Finish off Jolyne Cujoh.
Just that, and nothing more.

16:24.733 --> 16:26.568
I will merely complete my assignment.

16:31.615 --> 16:32.574
Where are they?

16:32.658 --> 16:35.160
Where did Jolyne Cujoh
and her two allies go?

16:35.786 --> 16:38.122
Have they already left the building?

16:38.205 --> 16:42.668
No, they cannot leave without me knowing.

16:43.502 --> 16:45.879
Hey you, what are you doing there?

16:46.714 --> 16:49.049
Hey, I'm talking to you.

16:49.550 --> 16:50.968
Where did those three go?

16:51.051 --> 16:53.470
And how did you manage
to avoid becoming a plant?

16:59.977 --> 17:02.771
Walk… outside…

17:02.855 --> 17:05.566
- Save me…
- How terrible.

17:05.649 --> 17:08.360
Someone restructured his body
into a human trap!

17:19.079 --> 17:21.457
Fuck, it hurts!

17:25.044 --> 17:28.213
Mommy, it hurts!

17:28.297 --> 17:30.966
I don't want this shitty arm anymore!

17:31.050 --> 17:33.969
I got screwed.

17:34.053 --> 17:37.598
I'm only here
because Pale Snake ordered me

17:37.681 --> 17:40.893
to cause a fight in here
with my Survivor Stand.

17:41.560 --> 17:43.395
But forget that now.

17:43.479 --> 17:46.106
I'm finally outside now.

17:47.608 --> 17:50.360
GUCCIO
STAND NAME: SURVIVOR - BEYOND RECOVERY

17:54.239 --> 17:58.535
Anyway, it looks like we got away
from the other Stand User.

17:59.745 --> 18:03.582
The plants withered away.
I guess it was a temporary bloom.

18:04.083 --> 18:06.919
The problem is that it's about time
for someone from the prison

18:07.002 --> 18:10.047
to realize the abnormalities
going on in the Disciplinary Wing.

18:10.130 --> 18:11.256
That works in our favor.

18:11.840 --> 18:16.178
Once that happens,
then Pale Snake will realize it too.

18:16.261 --> 18:17.721
He will appear close to us.

18:18.347 --> 18:21.767
This is the best chance yet of
getting my father's disc back.

18:25.771 --> 18:27.272
Jolyne, watch out!

18:36.949 --> 18:38.826
Stone Ocean!

18:42.996 --> 18:44.498
It's an enemy Stand!

18:44.581 --> 18:47.376
He must belong to that
gladiator-looking man!

18:47.459 --> 18:48.752
He swallowed the fruit!

18:48.836 --> 18:50.337
I won't let them have it!

18:52.381 --> 18:53.924
Asshole!

18:56.593 --> 18:57.761
Diver Drive!

19:02.850 --> 19:05.727
What is up with his body?

19:05.811 --> 19:08.772
He stinks… really bad!

19:08.856 --> 19:13.026
Go deeper, please!

19:13.110 --> 19:16.071
- Shit, my Stand can't enter it!
- Punish me more, please!

19:16.655 --> 19:18.949
I can feel it through my Stand!

19:19.533 --> 19:21.869
My body's starting to stink
from the inside!

19:22.452 --> 19:24.329
Those shoes of yours.

19:24.413 --> 19:28.709
Did my bodily liquid dirty them?
I am very sorry.

19:30.127 --> 19:32.754
Now please, come sit on this chair.

19:32.838 --> 19:36.925
Let me lick your shoes clean.

19:37.009 --> 19:40.721
Would you like this comic book?
I lifted it from the guards' break room.

19:41.805 --> 19:43.098
Careful, there's a bee.

19:43.724 --> 19:47.477
My master is named D an' G.

19:47.561 --> 19:50.230
The last I saw of him,
he was in the Disciplinary Wing.

19:50.314 --> 19:54.318
His right arm got ripped off
and he was crying for his mommy.

19:59.072 --> 20:01.241
It's a remotely controlled Stand!

20:01.325 --> 20:04.328
He wants to take the fruit to his User!

20:05.495 --> 20:07.915
Shit, they've noticed.
The guards are coming!

20:07.998 --> 20:10.626
Jolyne, we must leave for now.

20:10.709 --> 20:12.085
Let's go toward the wetlands.

20:12.169 --> 20:14.755
There must be a water bike
or a boat somewhere close.

20:19.551 --> 20:22.262
This is how to tell wild
strawberries apart.

20:22.346 --> 20:26.225
The ones with yellow flowers
are mock strawberries, so don't eat them.

20:26.308 --> 20:27.976
Shut your annoying trap.

20:28.560 --> 20:30.938
We can't leave this Stand alone.

20:31.438 --> 20:35.192
We need to find a way to get
that green child out of its belly.

20:35.275 --> 20:36.360
I know that.

20:36.860 --> 20:39.905
F.F., we have no choice but to take it.

20:39.988 --> 20:43.367
We'll leave you to find its User
and finish him off.

20:43.450 --> 20:44.618
Got it.

20:45.244 --> 20:48.830
Oh, you want me to go with you, Master.

20:54.711 --> 20:59.049
This boat here is built specifically
for the wetlands, Master.

20:59.132 --> 21:03.929
It has a propeller engine,
and it uses wind to propel forward.

21:04.012 --> 21:07.057
Shit, how do I start the ignition?

21:07.140 --> 21:09.142
Is there a lock somewhere?

21:09.226 --> 21:12.729
It's a throttle lever, Master.

21:12.813 --> 21:16.692
Usually, it must be put
in neutral first, like this.

21:19.903 --> 21:22.155
This stick is for steering.

21:22.239 --> 21:24.574
Push it forward to turn
the empennage to the right,

21:24.658 --> 21:28.036
and pull the stick back
to turn it to the left.

21:28.120 --> 21:30.914
- Release the tether.
- Yes, Master.

21:37.546 --> 21:41.008
Jolyne, do not take your eyes off
that Stand.

21:47.848 --> 21:52.394
While it's in your sight,
it'll act like an obedient servant.

21:52.477 --> 21:54.730
Though creepy,
it will prove useful to you.

21:54.813 --> 21:56.857
But turn your back on it
for a second, and…

22:04.656 --> 22:06.616
Fuck…

22:07.117 --> 22:09.286
Who would have thought that was an attack?

22:09.369 --> 22:11.747
Jolyne, Anastasia…

22:12.247 --> 22:14.750
Don't let it out of your sight!

23:41.294 --> 23:46.299
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
